  "text": "Palladium Price in the 2000s\nBetween the first (2000-01-31) and last (2009-12-30) monthly observations available for the 2000s, the LBMA palladium price went from $484 to $393 — a decline of 19% — with a sampled high of $1,050 (Jan 2001) and a sampled low of $154 (Apr 2003).\nYears in the 2000s\n2000\n2001\n2002\n2003\n2004\n2005\n2006\n2007\n2008\n2009\nSee today's live palladium price on the\nspot dashboard\n, or\nshop palladium bullion\nat Bullion Trading LLC.\nData retrieved 2026-09-26. Latest observation for this metal: 2026-09-25. The current month is provisional.\nSources, sampling and calculation methodology\n.\nPrepared by the\nBullion Trading LLC editorial team\n.",
